		{
			dependencies: ["4D96DE63E82D8EAA"]
			description: [
				"This world hosts a wide variety of biome diversity; this also entails a variety of temperature locales that may be undesirable for your fragile body."
				""
				"Your body temperature is affected by several factors."
				""
				"&eThe Time of Day"
				"Season"
				"Blocks nearby"
				"Being outside or indoors"
				"Being Dry or Wet&r"
				""
				"The Sewing Table allows you to apply various coatings to your armor which modify temperature resistances, they're pretty bad and I think I will end up buffing them in the future."
				""
				"Cooling Coat - &cHeat Resistance&r"
				"Warming Coat - &bCold Resistance&r"
				"Thermal Coat - &5Thermal Resistance&r (Resists both hot/cold)"
				""
				""
				"There are various Potions which can make you able to resist or completely immune to hot/cold effects.  Though Heat/Ice Immunity Potions shouldn't ever really be needed and may be swapped with more unique methods in the future"
			]
