		{
			dependencies: ["4276E47E7CF85DF0"]
			description: [
				"You'll need several of the tools listed below, here's some of their basic functions."
				""
				"&6Hammers&r are used to make ingots into plates."
				""
				"&6Wrenches&r are used to break GregTech blocks, as well as to set the output face of machines."
				""
				"&6Screwdrivers&r are used to interact with machine covers."
				""
				"&6Wire cutters&r are used to cut plates into wires as well as connect wires/cables."
				""
				"&6Files&r are used to make ingots into rods."
				""
				"&6Mortars&r are used to grind down metals and other materials."
				""
				"&6Saws&r are used to cut apart rods, planks, and other various things that need to be split apart."
				""
				"While there are several tools not mentioned here, these are the ones required to get through early game gregtech. Almost all the crafting functionality of these hand tools will be superceded by machines once you unlock LV and basic electricity, but some of the tools (screwdriver and wrench in particular) will become a mainstay in your inventory. While you are still using the tools for crafting, expect to go through them fairly quickly. Don't get too attached..."
				""
				"Remember your workplace safety! Don't lose your fingers.."
			]
