		{
			dependencies: ["4D96DE63E82D8EAA"]
			description: [
				""
				"\"&l&bFrontiers Monarch&r\" - Given to those who have seen the story of Frontiers to the end, for every ending. Unobtainable as of current release and won't be attainable until 1.0.0"
				""
				"\"&l&4Frontiers Dominator&r\" - Given to those who complete the pack with the &ndefault settings&r."
				""
				"Disabling Curated Configs/Difficulty Mods Will Invalidate this role."
				""
				"\"&l&aFrontiers Conqueror&r\" - Given to those who complete the pack with difficulty nerfs/changes (Eg, disable temp, ae2 channels, mostly play peaceful etc)"
				""
